### What problem does this feature solve?

控件在移动端二次开发时，会弹出键盘，给控件增加一个readOnly属性，解决控件弹出键盘问题

### What does the proposed API look like?

路径：src/editor/core/draw/control/Control.ts
`  public getIsReadOnlyControl(context: IControlContext = {}): boolean {
    if (this.draw.isDesignMode() || !this.activeControl) return false
    const {startIndex, endIndex} = context.range || this.range.getRange()
    if (startIndex === endIndex && ~startIndex && ~endIndex) {
      const elementList = context.elementList || this.getElementList()
      const startElement = elementList[startIndex]
      if (startElement.controlComponent === ControlComponent.POSTFIX) {
        return false
      }
    }
    return !!this.activeControl.getElement()?.control?.readonly
  }`

![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbf25962-ebe9-4784-a255-005b3ef0cd1c)

路径：src/editor/core/event/CanvasEvent.ts
`  public click() {
    // IOS系统限制非用户主动触发事件的键盘弹出
    // if (isIOS && !this.draw.isReadonly()) {
    //   this.draw.getCursor().getAgentDom().focus()
    // }
    this.draw.getCursor().getAgentDom().readOnly = false
    if (this.getDraw().getControl().getIsReadOnlyControl() && !this.draw.isReadonly()) {
      this.draw.getCursor().getAgentDom().readOnly = true
    } else if (isIOS && !this.draw.isReadonly()) {
      this.draw.getCursor().getAgentDom().focus()
    }
  }`

